WEBVTT

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:07.090
Are you thinking about Tohru?

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.550
Did you turn telepathic or something?

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.220
It's not like you're Remy.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.850
I know everything about you, Lord Kyohma.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.680
Naturally grown Darjeeling?

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.100
You like it, right?

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.860
But the Public Safety Department designated that stuff a class 2 restricted good, right?

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:31.360
The laws of Melchizedek
mean nothing to a Katagiri.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.370
I always cause you trouble.

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:46.130
About Tohru, and about Kyoka...

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:55.550
Then please give me a reward.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:57.510
What do you want?

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:08.520
After the next battle, I'd simply like
60 minutes of your time, Lord Kyohma.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:13.110
Time, huh?

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.700
What we're currently fighting for...
the greatest luxury on the planet.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:25.790
All right.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:03.010
Confrontation: Those Who Defend Time

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:02.470
Be careful!

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:03.470
Sorry!

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:06.470
Maybe bringing two people with no experience on the same mission wasn't a good idea...

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:08.520
Sidune, about my little sister...

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:10.150
<i>Leave her to me!</i>

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:12.650
I'll play with you right now!

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.360
Eat this!

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:17.740
At that rate, he's eventually going to run out of bullets.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.240
Wow, they really do look like us...

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:24.030
<i>Lady Kyoka, you shouldn't overextend your position!</i>

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:26.080
You can't get away!

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:29.620
Listen to what others tell you, you tomboy!

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:31.330
Who did you call a tomboy?

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:35.840
<i>Kyohma!</i>

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.840
<i>That girl may be nearby!</i>

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:39.630
The ghost?

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.010
Change of plans!

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:43.850
Sidune, Kyoka, rendezvous with me!

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:46.260
Be careful.

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:50.230
Time... will end...

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:53.310
The future hasn't been determined yet.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:58.740
<i>Squad A has entered combat.
Some have been injured!</i>

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:01.570
Lord Kyohma's field...

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:04.780
They separated us?

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.030
Big Brother!

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.460
Don't get in my way!

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:12.670
Kyohma! Behind you!

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.070
Sidune!

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:43.860
It's over, me.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.530
Sidune!

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:53.210
Sidune!

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:54.620
Kyohma!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.710
Damn it! Are we out of time?

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:09.720
Sidune is... Sidune is...

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:27.820
Lord Kyohma! Lord Kyohma!

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:31.330
I'll make sure they pay for this...

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:53.810
If only... if only I hadn't gone looking for that ghost, this never would've happened!

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:56.560
It's my fault! It's my fault...

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:58.520
...that Sidune...

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.570
That's enough.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:07.450
I'm the one who told you you could go.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:10.490
But even so... even so I...

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.500
Shut up!

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:17.080
Don't spit on Sidune's resolve.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.790
What? You're not going to punch me?

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.260
There's no point in fighting you.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:30.180
That's enough.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.930
People die. Anyone can.

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:43.820
Materializing the Energy Cube
in the present temporal axis.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:47.780
It's too small a reward
for the life of a woman.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:51.370
You can't measure the value of a life.

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:57.540
But, if you can't win the victory for us,
our future will be eradicated.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:01.000
And for that, we need more Energy Cubes.

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:05.300
Right. It's a wonderful marathon you get to run
while coughing up blood.

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:08.590
I'm so happy I could puke.

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.080
As promised, Sidune.

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:43.250
I'll have tea alone with you
for 60 minutes.

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.050
I won't let anyone interrupt.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:49.760
This is time for just you and me...

00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:56.350
Minori hasn't been at school for two days now.
You know anything?

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.730
I heard that she's missing.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:03.360
There's got to be some log
from the surveillance cameras, right?

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:07.820
I'm telling you,
she turned to sand and blew away.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:10.570
What? That rumor again?

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:12.820
Well, it's probably a guy. Some guy.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:13.820
Totally.

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:15.530
Okay, let's get to school!

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:29.340
<i>Transmission from the Timekeepers.</i>

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:37.060
What is this?

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:48.570
I'm sorry. There was no reply
when I knocked.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.450
It's not your fault, Tohru.

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:59.160
Sidune protected my big brother.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:03.000
But if I hadn't gone scouting,

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:07.920
or if I had come back sooner, I'm sure it wouldn't have happened.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:13.050
If you had come back, Tohru,
would you have shot your other self?

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:17.390
Is everything bad that happens 
in the world your responsibility?

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:21.020
Tell me!

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:26.810
Does the fact that I couldn't protect
Big Brother or Sidune not matter at all?

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:32.990
I'm sorry.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:38.530
I should be the one that knows more
about the pain of losing one's family.

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:44.960
You never imagine somebody's
going to just die like that!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.210
Kyoka...

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:52.920
<i>Emergency. Emergency.</i>

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:55.970
<i>The Timekeepers have specified the next stage.</i>

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:59.100
<i>All eligible personnel
please gather in the briefing room.</i>

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:11.690
This time it isn't the usual free-for-all. 
Another victory condition has been given.

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:13.900
Victory condition?

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:18.570
What does that mean?

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:20.280
Please look here.

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:23.240
There is a gate set up at this point.

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:29.710
The side that reaches it first will receive five times as many Energy Cubes as we've been given previously.

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:31.800
That is what the Timekeepers have told us.

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:33.250
Five times?

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:36.550
Five times, huh?

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.300
They're getting pretty bold.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:44.720
Hey, Big Brother.

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:46.890
Is a five-times greater reward really that amazing?

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:52.980
Energy Cubes directly power up
our weapons and defensive fields.

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:55.860
Since it's the exact same people fighting,

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:59.200
the number of Cubes each side has determines their power.

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:03.790
This time, we'll split the formation
into a forward team that will charge the gate,

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:07.330
and a backup team that will support them.

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.920
The formation will be as follows...

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:23.680
Why do you fight?

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:25.890
I fight for Lord Kyohma.

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:28.890
We'll be using everyone we have for this fight.

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:31.810
I'll leave the preliminary bombardment to Lyudmila.

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:35.400
I'm sure the enemy will have
a Pantagruel class ready, too.

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:38.280
I'm working on a combat strength analysis.

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:42.530
If we can shave off 20% of the
 enemy's strength before engaging...

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:49.960
As long as I can help him,
I don't care what happens to me.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.880
As for the forward members...

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:59.590
Please let me do it!

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:00.680
Tohru?

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:06.930
After reviewing everyone's parameters,
I feel that I'm the best suited.

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:11.980
I see. Indeed, your evasion rating
is the best we have by far.

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:14.190
Wait. He won't cut it.

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.480
No, I should be doing this.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:22.280
If we don't pick the best options here, we'll regret it when the Degradation destroys our world.

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:25.660
You were crying like a little boy just a little bit ago!

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:26.700
Big Brother?

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:27.790
Quiet, Kyoka.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:30.370
What will it be, Tohru?

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:31.750
I can do this!

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:33.710
I will get it done.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:34.790
Is that so?

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:47.100
Fine with me.

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:01.650
But to think they'd suddenly
change the rules on us...

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:06.570
Do you think the Timekeepers are making fun of us?

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.370
If so, they need to be punished.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:23.550
I've been waiting for you.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:26.510
This is the shield unit you requested.

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:28.220
Thank you.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:34.940
This is directly linked to your Energy Cube,
so it will put an additional load on the cube when used.

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:36.060
Please be mindful of that.

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:37.900
Yeah, I'll be careful.

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:40.860
Please give Doctor Odhner my thanks!

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:55.040
That boy named Tohru joining us,
and the Timekeepers changing their plans...

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:57.330
Doctor, is this all a coincidence?

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:04.840
The Timekeepers informed us that eligible people like you
are factors that greatly affect history.

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:06.550
That goes for both temporal axes.

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:10.260
That's why we're always up against ourselves.

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:13.430
I understand that,
but why change the objectives?

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:17.770
It's a bad habit of the military
to jump to conclusions, Aaron.

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:25.820
Is he the factor that
will bring change to the world?

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:28.240
Or is he just an irregular factor?

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:29.370
I'm sure...

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:33.580
...that this fight will tell us.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:38.250
Kyohma, do you plan to fight
just like the Timekeepers tell you to?

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:39.710
Of course not.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.510
There's no way can I seriously
believe a group like that.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:48.260
Perhaps the Timekeepers are trying
to hide something they don't want us to know.

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:54.520
That's why they attack the ghosts, huh?

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:56.730
I see.

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:02.360
You've changed a bit.

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:08.280
When my parents died,
I never thought I'd lose anybody again.

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:12.780
I stopped wanting to get
 involved with anyone. But...

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:15.410
...it's painful to lose another person, isn't it?

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:19.670
That's why...

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:22.750
...I want to make up for Sidune's death.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:25.260
I'll fight for that cause!

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:28.510
Then, never look back.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.300
I've got your back!

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:41.560
Until we break through,
stay hidden and don't come out!

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:44.110
If you do and everyone clumps up,
they'll gang up on you!

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:45.690
Got it.

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:46.940
Stay safe!

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:48.570
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.920
Forward team has started their descent.

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:04.130
Lyudmila, prepare the preliminary bombardment.

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:05.710
Confirming coordinates.

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:09.420
Target locked.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:12.590
Confirming error adjustments from terrestrial magnetism
and the Earth's rotation.

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:14.720
Mode Vritra booting up.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:17.600
Removing photon reactor limiter.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:20.060
Unlocking final safety.

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:20.940
Firing!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:43.080
This is to avenge Lord Kyohma!

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:57.260
So that's the target, huh?

00:16:57.640 --> 00:17:00.270
It's pretty tall for a building of this era.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:05.360
<i>Akira Rakando is seriously injured.</i>

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:07.440
<i>Retreating from Point Echo.</i>

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:10.820
<i>Lyudmila, pull the line back
and reposition to Echo.</i>

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:13.110
Dammit! I still can't move?

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.700
Do your best, Remy!

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:23.670
If we can lock this place down,
we can secure Tohru's entry route!

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:25.880
I know that!

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:27.750
I'll get it done!

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:31.840
Geez, why do I have to do it
for someone like him?

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:35.220
Enemy forces have retreated from area Delta.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:39.970
<i>It's about time. We'll use the forward team to advance our line.</i>

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:58.240
I knew you'd show.

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.540
Hey, me from the other side!

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:06.420
Why isn't Tohru at your side?

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:09.210
That has nothing to do with you!

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:16.050
Tohru loves me.

00:18:16.300 --> 00:18:19.140
But hasn't Tohru abandoned you?

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:24.890
You'd better dodge this, Remy!

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:32.900
Look out, Kyoka!

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:35.200
Don't mess with me!

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.540
So it's Big Sister?

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.970
It's not like her...

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:05.770
She missed the vitals.

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.240
So there you are!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.170
If you can do it, so can I!

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:34.000
Oh, well done.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:36.460
I'll avenge Sidune!

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.140
Ma'am?

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:56.320
What should I do...
At this rate she'll...

00:20:01.070 --> 00:20:01.910
You idiot!

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:03.320
Kyohma!

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:07.580
Don't look behind you!
Was what you said back there just a lie?

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:13.130
<i>I won't give up on our future!</i>

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:15.710
Kyohma, I'm trusting you
with our teacher!

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:30.270
I won't let you go any further!

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:25.530
There it is!

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:28.070
Dog-Doggin'! Let's start in high spirits!

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:29.370
Dogma changed his image?

00:23:29.370 --> 00:23:30.820
I don't want to be all gloomy anymore!

00:23:30.820 --> 00:23:33.410
Nothing good about
being needlessly cheerful, either...

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:35.120
M-Magma turned into sand?

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:37.150
N-Next episode: "Revelation."

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:40.040
<b><i>Revelation </i></b>Two Histories

00:23:37.150 --> 00:23:38.420
"Two Histories."

00:23:38.420 --> 00:23:39.960
Nothing I do works.
